00:33.500 --> 00:35.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.367 --> 00:37.700
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.700 --> 00:39.633
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.633 --> 00:40.967
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:42.833
SquarePants!
方裤！

