01:01.733 --> 01:02.733
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

01:02.733 --> 01:03.933
Watch this.
注意这个。

01:03.933 --> 01:06.633
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:06.633 --> 01:09.067
[slurping]
[发出声音]

01:09.067 --> 01:10.067
[burps]
[打嗝]

01:10.067 --> 01:13.067
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:13.067 --> 01:14.067
[both exclaim]
[两人惊呼]

01:14.067 --> 01:16.133
- Mmm--hey.
- Hey.
- 嗯 - 嘿。
- 嘿。

01:16.133 --> 01:18.633
[both repeating "Hey"]
[两人都重复着“嘿”]

01:18.633 --> 01:19.800
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

01:19.800 --> 01:20.800
Hiyah!
嗨！

01:20.800 --> 01:22.767
Hiyah, hiyah!
嗨呀呀！

01:22.767 --> 01:24.467
