[吸气、喘气]

01:47.800 --> 01:49.900
Oh, my tree is dying.
哦，我的树快死了。

01:49.900 --> 01:50.900
[ax chops]
[斧头砍]

01:50.900 --> 01:53.067
- Good, we can use the wood.
- 很好，我们可以用木头。

01:53.067 --> 01:54.200
- Patrick, stop.
- 帕特里克，停下来。

01:54.200 --> 01:56.800
I can save it with science.
我可以用科学拯救它。

01:56.800 --> 01:58.067
- Okay.
Hmm.
- 好的。
唔。

01:58.067 --> 01:59.067
[glass cracks]
[玻璃裂纹]

01:59.067 --> 02:00.633
[sad music]
[悲伤的音乐]

02:00.633 --> 02:02.367
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

02:02.367 --> 02:05.333
[monitor beeping]
[监视器蜂鸣声]

02:05.333 --> 02:07.633
- Feed me.
- 喂我。

02:07.633 --> 02:10.300
- Jumping beans on a trampoline.
- 在蹦床上跳豆子。

02:10.300 --> 02:11.633
You're starving.
你快饿死了。

02:11.633 --> 02:13.467
I got to make you
the best fertilizer
我必须让你
最好的肥料

02:13.467 --> 02:15.067
known to critter-kind.
为小动物所熟知。

02:15.067 --> 02:17.067
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

02:17.067 --> 02:18.067
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:18.067 --> 02:19.267
[yells]
[喊叫]

02:19.267 --> 02:22.100
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:22.100 --> 02:23.100
Ugh.
啊。

02:23.100 --> 02:24.100
[choking]
[窒息]

02:24.100 --> 02:25.700
[blows falling]
[击落]

02:25.700 --> 02:29.133
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

02:29.133 --> 02:31.133
Ah, growth pills.
啊，生长药。

02:31.133 --> 02:32.200
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:32.200 --> 02:35.600
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:35.600 --> 02:36.600
Hmm.
唔。

02:36.600 --> 02:37.400
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:37.400 --> 02:39.833
[fanfare]
[大张旗鼓]

02:39.833 --> 02:40.833
Hey.
嘿。

02:43.167 --> 02:44.167
[sad music]
[悲伤的音乐]

02:44.167 --> 02:45.633
Nuts.
坚果。

02:45.633 --> 02:48.600
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:48.600 --> 02:50.333
Aha.
啊哈。

02:50.333 --> 02:51.833
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:51.833 --> 02:54.767
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

02:54.767 --> 02:56.833
Yeehaw!
耶哈！

02:58.067 --> 03:01.267
[humming cheerfully]
[欢快地哼唱]

03:02.900 --> 03:05.067
Aw, I hope
this is the pick-me-up
噢，我希望
这是提神剂

03:05.067 --> 03:06.467
you needed, ole girl.
你需要，老女孩。

03:06.467 --> 03:08.133
[leaves rustling]
[树叶沙沙作响]

03:08.133 --> 03:09.133
[exclaims]
[惊呼]

03:09.133 --> 03:10.967
Well, kiss my grits.
好吧，亲吻我的玉米粒。

03:10.967 --> 03:14.167
This here's the biggest acorn
I ever did see.
这是最大的橡子
我曾经见过。

03:14.167 --> 03:15.167
[leaves rustling]
[树叶沙沙作响]

03:15.167 --> 03:16.867
[acorns falling]
[橡子掉落]

03:16.867 --> 03:18.167
And so are those.
那些也是如此。

03:18.167 --> 03:20.333
I'd better start
storing these for winter.
我最好开始
把这些储存起来过冬。

03:20.333 --> 03:22.667
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

03:22.667 --> 03:26.400
I might need
an alternate storage solution.
我可能需要
替代存储解决方案。

03:27.300 --> 03:30.300
[groaning]
[呻吟]

03:30.300 --> 03:32.133
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:32.133 --> 03:34.267
Phew.
唷。

03:34.267 --> 03:35.433
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:35.433 --> 03:37.633
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:37.633 --> 03:40.067
