[叹气]

04:04.333 --> 04:06.167
- Stop!
- 停止！

04:06.167 --> 04:07.600
- Whoa.
Who are you?
- 哇哦。
你是谁？

04:07.600 --> 04:10.967
- I am the spirit guide
of the Salmon people.
- 我是精神导师
鲑鱼人的。

04:10.967 --> 04:13.233
I am a shalmon.
我是一条鲑鱼。

04:13.233 --> 04:14.333
- Oh, hey there, shalmon.
- 哦，嘿，沙蒙。

04:14.333 --> 04:15.533
My name is SpongeBob.
我的名字是海绵宝宝。

04:15.533 --> 04:17.300
- Why do you dump your nuts
- 为什么你要扔掉你的坚果

04:17.300 --> 04:18.667
on my people's land, SpongeBob?
在我人民的土地上，海绵宝宝？

04:18.667 --> 04:19.800
- Oh, they're not mine.
- 哦，他们不是我的。

04:19.800 --> 04:21.067
They're my friend Sandy's.
他们是我朋友桑迪的。

04:21.067 --> 04:23.867
- Allow me to give you
some sage advice.
- 请允许我给你
一些明智的建议。

04:23.867 --> 04:26.500
You must not squander
nature's bounty.
你一定不能浪费
大自然的恩赐。

04:26.500 --> 04:29.300
Nuts are meant to be eaten.
坚果是用来吃的。

04:29.300 --> 04:30.500
It's all in my book.
这一切都在我的书中。

04:30.500 --> 04:32.267
[flute music]
[长笛音乐]

04:32.267 --> 04:34.633
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:34.633 --> 04:36.367
Meant to be eaten, eh?
本来就是要吃的吧？

04:36.367 --> 04:37.600
- Of course.
- 当然。

04:37.600 --> 04:39.667
The earth provides our food,
地球为我们提供食物，

04:39.667 --> 04:42.467
and we must care for her
in return.
我们必须照顾她
作为回报。

04:42.467 --> 04:44.567
It's all about balance,
my friend.
一切都是为了平衡，
我的朋友。

04:44.567 --> 04:46.100
Look at my garden.
看看我的花园。

04:46.100 --> 04:47.733
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

04:47.733 --> 04:50.200
- Wow.
It's coming in great.
- 哇。
一切进展顺利。

04:50.200 --> 04:52.067
[jungle animals calling]
[丛林动物的叫声]

04:52.067 --> 04:53.133
[stammering]
[结巴]

04:53.133 --> 04:54.300
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

04:54.300 --> 04:55.967
Over there.
在那边。

04:55.967 --> 04:57.167
[birds chirping]
[鸟鸣声]

04:57.167 --> 04:59.200
- Even better.
- 甚至更好。

04:59.200 --> 05:01.067
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

05:01.067 --> 05:03.500
- So some shalmon guy
told you people would want
- 一些鲑鱼家伙
告诉你人们会想要

05:03.500 --> 05:05.100
to eat my nuts,
and you believe him?
吃我的坚果，
你相信他吗？

05:05.100 --> 05:06.300
- Uh-huh, uh-huh.
- 嗯嗯，嗯嗯。

05:06.300 --> 05:08.100
Surely the shalmon
isn't a sham.
肯定是鲑鱼
不是假的。

05:08.100 --> 05:09.100
- Shirtainly not.
- 绝对不是。

05:09.100 --> 05:10.667
I mean, certainly not.
我的意思是，当然不是。

05:10.667 --> 05:12.100
Let's see what we can cook up.
让我们看看我们能做什么。

05:12.100 --> 05:13.100
"Aged nut brie,
“陈年坚果布里干酪，

05:13.100 --> 05:14.100
ghost nut chili."
鬼坚果辣椒。”

05:14.100 --> 05:15.400
How about nutty butter?
坚果黄油怎么样？

05:15.400 --> 05:17.100
Seems easy enough to make.
看起来很容易制作。

05:17.100 --> 05:18.467
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:18.467 --> 05:21.467
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

05:21.467 --> 05:23.233
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:23.233 --> 05:25.967
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:25.967 --> 05:28.967
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:28.967 --> 05:32.967
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:32.967 --> 05:34.433
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

05:34.433 --> 05:37.067
That's delicious.
真好吃。

05:37.067 --> 05:38.067
- Wow.
- 哇。

05:38.067 --> 05:39.233
Patrick will want to try this.
帕特里克会想尝试一下。

05:39.233 --> 05:40.233
- Try what?
- 尝试什么？

05:40.233 --> 05:42.233
[both yell]
[两人大喊]

05:42.233 --> 05:44.233
- [laughing]
- [笑]

05:44.233 --> 05:46.367
- Patrick, that nutty butter
is for eating.
- 帕特里克，坚果黄油
是为了吃饭。

05:46.367 --> 05:48.900
- I know.
- 我知道。

05:48.900 --> 05:49.900
Ow!
噢！

05:49.900 --> 05:51.067
Mmm.
嗯。

05:51.067 --> 05:52.200
Ow!
噢！

05:52.200 --> 05:53.200
Mmm.
嗯。

05:53.200 --> 05:54.200
Ow!
噢！

05:54.200 --> 05:55.267
- Hmm.
- 唔。

05:55.267 --> 05:56.300
Why don't you boys take some
男孩们为什么不拿一些呢？

05:56.300 --> 05:57.300
for the road?
为了道路？

05:57.300 --> 05:59.867
both: Thanks.
两人：谢谢。

05:59.867 --> 06:01.067
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

06:01.067 --> 06:02.367
[knocking at door]
Huh?
[敲门]
啊？

06:02.367 --> 06:04.467
- Can I have some more?
- 我可以再要一些吗？

06:04.467 --> 06:07.633
It's hard to eat
off this side of me.
很难吃
在我的这一边。

06:07.633 --> 06:09.933
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:09.933 --> 06:10.800
- Sure, Patrick.
- 当然，帕特里克。

06:10.800 --> 06:12.267
Here's the last of it.
这是最后一个。

06:12.267 --> 06:13.467
- Thanks, Sandy.
- 谢谢，桑迪。

06:13.467 --> 06:15.133
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:15.133 --> 06:17.433
- There, everything's back
to normal.
- 好了，一切都回来了
至正常。

06:17.433 --> 06:19.400
crowd: We love nutty butter.
- What in tarnation?
人群：我们喜欢坚果黄油。
- 塔尼翁什么？

06:19.400 --> 06:23.567
crowd: We love nutty butter.
We love nutty butter.
人群：我们喜欢坚果黄油。
我们喜欢坚果黄油。

06:23.567 --> 06:25.567
We love nutty butter.
- Hi, Sandy.
我们喜欢坚果黄油。
- 嗨，桑迪。

06:25.567 --> 06:27.367
- Patrick, what's going on here?
- 帕特里克，这是怎么回事？

06:27.367 --> 06:28.433
- I want more nutty butter.
- 我想要更多坚果黄油。

06:28.433 --> 06:29.933
- Who are all these people?
- 这些人都是谁？

06:29.933 --> 06:31.933
crowd: We love nutty butter.
We love nutty butter.
人群：我们喜欢坚果黄油。
我们喜欢坚果黄油。

06:31.933 --> 06:35.867
- Oh, they licked
the nutty butter off my back.
- 哦，他们舔了
我背上的坚果黄油。

06:35.867 --> 06:37.633
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:37.633 --> 06:39.700
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

06:39.700 --> 06:41.100
And now they're here for more.
现在他们来这里是为了更多。

06:41.100 --> 06:42.400
- Aw, gosh, Patrick,
- 噢，天哪，帕特里克，

06:42.400 --> 06:44.333
I don't have enough
to feed everyone.
我没有足够的
养活每个人。

06:44.333 --> 06:47.733
- But it's the only thing
my boy will eat.
- 但这是唯一的事情
我的儿子会吃。

06:47.733 --> 06:51.133
- Guess I'll have to go to bed
hungry again.
- 我想我得去睡觉了
又饿了。

06:51.133 --> 06:53.100
[all complaining]
[大家都在抱怨]

06:53.100 --> 06:55.767
- Well, I don't want
to let anyone down.
- 好吧，我不想
让任何人失望。

06:55.767 --> 06:58.933
I can make some more acorns.
我可以再做一些橡子。

06:58.933 --> 07:02.067
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

07:02.067 --> 07:09.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:09.067 --> 07:10.400
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

07:10.400 --> 07:12.667
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:12.667 --> 07:14.567
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

07:14.567 --> 07:16.133
- Mmm.
- 嗯。

07:16.133 --> 07:17.533
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

07:17.533 --> 07:19.333
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

07:19.333 --> 07:21.733
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:21.733 --> 07:23.767
- Making everyone's day
with my nutty butter
- 让每个人都开心
和我的坚果黄油

07:23.767 --> 07:26.300
really gives me
the warm and tinglies.
真的给了我
温暖而刺痛。

07:26.300 --> 07:27.433
- Uh-huh.
- 呃哈。

07:27.433 --> 07:29.467
- In fact, demand's been
so high,
- 事实上，需求一直
这么高，

07:29.467 --> 07:32.333
I scienced up a way
to increase my production.
我想出了一个科学方法
来增加我的产量。

07:32.333 --> 07:35.200
[upbeat instrumental music]
[欢快的器乐]

07:35.200 --> 07:38.600
SpongeBob here scoops acorns
onto the conveyor belt.
海绵宝宝在这里舀橡子
到传送带上。

07:38.600 --> 07:40.733
Then the tubes take them inside,
然后管子把它们带进去，

07:40.733 --> 07:43.300
where I turn them
into nutty butter.
我把它们转向哪里
变成坚果黄油。

07:43.300 --> 07:46.600
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:46.600 --> 07:48.500
- Sandy, according
to the shalmon's book,
- 桑迪，根据
到沙门的书里，

07:48.500 --> 07:51.733
we shouldn't try to force nature
to give us more than she's able.
我们不应该试图强迫自然
给我们比她能力更多的东西。

07:51.733 --> 07:53.867
- Don't worry about my tree,
SpongeBob.
- 别担心我的树
海绵宝宝。

07:53.867 --> 07:56.467
Worry about the crowd
of nutty butter fans outside.
担心人群拥挤
外面的坚果黄油粉丝。

07:56.467 --> 08:00.067
all: We want nutty butter.
We want nutty butter.
所有人：我们想要坚果黄油。
我们想要坚果黄油。

08:00.067 --> 08:01.867
- We're gonna need
a lot more acorns
- 我们需要
还有更多的橡子

08:01.867 --> 08:03.667
to feed them all.
养活他们所有人。

08:03.667 --> 08:07.533
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:07.533 --> 08:10.533
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

08:10.533 --> 08:12.200
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:12.200 --> 08:14.100
[leaves rustling]
[树叶沙沙作响]

08:14.100 --> 08:15.100
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:15.100 --> 08:16.433
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

08:16.433 --> 08:18.400
Sandy's tree's
not looking so good.
桑迪的树
看起来不太好。

08:18.400 --> 08:21.167
I don't think it can take
much more of this, Patrick.
我认为这不能
还有更多这样的事情，帕特里克。

08:21.167 --> 08:22.067
- Hmm.
- 唔。

08:22.067 --> 08:23.833
It's like Sandy said.
就像桑迪说的那样。

08:23.833 --> 08:26.667
"Something, something,
something, science."
“某事，某事，
一些东西，科学。”

08:26.667 --> 08:30.300
And who are we to argue
with science?
我们该与谁争论
与科学？

08:30.300 --> 08:32.067
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:32.067 --> 08:36.100
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:36.100 --> 08:37.100
Oh, no.
哦，不。

08:37.100 --> 08:38.133
The nuts stopped.
坚果停了下来。

08:38.133 --> 08:40.333
- Hold on.
I got this.
- 坚持，稍等。
我明白了。

08:40.333 --> 08:42.700
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:42.700 --> 08:46.300
[yelling]
[大喊]

08:46.300 --> 08:47.667
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

08:47.667 --> 08:48.733
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

08:48.733 --> 08:50.233
Patrick, we have
to do something.
帕特里克，我们有
做某事。

08:50.233 --> 08:52.667
Sandy'll never forgive us
if we ruin her tree.
桑迪永远不会原谅我们
如果我们毁了她的树。

08:52.667 --> 08:56.200
- And I'll never forgive her
if she runs out of nutty butter.
- 我永远不会原谅她
如果她用完了坚果黄油。

08:56.200 --> 08:59.200
- [exclaiming]
- [惊呼]

08:59.200 --> 09:02.267
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:02.267 --> 09:04.800
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:04.800 --> 09:07.467
- Please, please, no pushing.
- 拜托，拜托，不要催促。

09:07.467 --> 09:08.867
I'll make more.
我会做更多。

09:08.867 --> 09:12.300
Remember, Sandy's the squirrel
you can count on.
记住，桑迪是松鼠
您可以信赖。

09:12.300 --> 09:13.767
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

09:15.667 --> 09:16.667
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

09:16.667 --> 09:17.933
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:17.933 --> 09:20.067
What in the sam hill
is going on around here?
山姆山有什么
这附近有什么事吗？

09:20.067 --> 09:22.433
- The tree got real sick.
- Don't worry.
- 这棵树病得很厉害。
- 不用担心。

09:22.433 --> 09:25.800
I made more nutty butter
with the rest of the nuts.
我做了更多坚果黄油
和其余的坚果。

09:25.800 --> 09:27.200
- You used all the nuts?
- 你用了所有的坚果吗？

09:27.200 --> 09:28.400
Jumpin' jiminy.
跳跃吉米尼。

09:28.400 --> 09:29.833
Time for another dose
of fertilizer.
是时候再服一剂了
肥料。

09:29.833 --> 09:31.267
- Sandy, wait.
- 桑迪，等等。

09:31.267 --> 09:32.900
I don't think that's what
your tree needs.
我不认为是这样
你的树需要。

09:32.900 --> 09:34.733
- The boy is right.
- 这个男孩是对的。

09:34.733 --> 09:36.533
Why do you hurt your tree?
你为什么要伤害你的树？

09:36.533 --> 09:38.167
A tree would never hurt you.
一棵树永远不会伤害你。

09:38.167 --> 09:39.267
Ouch!
哎哟!

09:39.267 --> 09:41.333
Dang splinters.
当当碎片。

09:41.333 --> 09:42.433
- Shalmon?
- 沙蒙？

09:42.433 --> 09:44.367
- Wait, you're the one
who said
- 等等，你就是那个
谁说的

09:44.367 --> 09:46.433
I should feed my nuts
to the people?
我应该喂我的坚果
对人民？

09:46.433 --> 09:47.433
- Indeed.
- 的确。

09:47.433 --> 09:48.667
But to feed so many
但养活这么多人

09:48.667 --> 09:50.500
from a single tree...
从一棵树...

09:50.500 --> 09:52.767
Let me share with you a story.
让我和你分享一个故事。

09:52.767 --> 09:56.067
Long ago, before fish
walked the seas,
很久以前，在鱼之前
走过大海，

09:56.067 --> 09:58.633
there lived in the sky
one sun.
天空中住着
一个太阳。

09:58.633 --> 10:00.233
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

10:00.233 --> 10:01.433
- One star.
- 一颗星。

10:01.433 --> 10:02.567
- Hello.
- 你好。

10:02.567 --> 10:03.667
- And one moon.
- 还有一个月亮。

10:03.667 --> 10:04.667
- What the--
- 什么是--

10:04.667 --> 10:06.033
- During the day,
- 白天，

10:06.033 --> 10:08.433
the star would play
with the sun.
明星会演奏
与太阳。

10:08.433 --> 10:09.733
At night, the star
晚上，星星

10:09.733 --> 10:11.000
would play with the moon.
会和月亮一起玩。

10:11.000 --> 10:13.867
- [giggling]
- Get away from me!
- [咯咯笑]
- 离我远点！

10:13.867 --> 10:16.733
- The star did not want
to let his friends down,
- 明星不想
让他的朋友失望，

10:16.733 --> 10:18.300
but he alone could not keep up
但他一个人跟不上

10:18.300 --> 10:20.433
with both the sun
and the moon.
与两个太阳
和月亮。

10:20.433 --> 10:22.133
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

10:22.133 --> 10:23.400
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

10:23.400 --> 10:25.333
- Finally, some peace.
- 终于，平静了。

10:25.333 --> 10:28.300
- That is when the star
had an idea.
- 那是明星的时候
有一个想法。

10:28.300 --> 10:30.167
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

10:30.167 --> 10:32.000
- Huh?
Huh?
- 啊？
啊？

10:32.000 --> 10:33.167
Oh, no.
- [giggling]
哦，不。
- [咯咯笑]

10:33.167 --> 10:35.033
- There goes the neighborhood.
- 邻居走了。

10:35.033 --> 10:37.100
- By creating many copies,
- 通过创建许多副本，

10:37.100 --> 10:40.533
the star was able to keep
the sun and moon happy,
这位明星能够保留
太阳和月亮快乐，

10:40.533 --> 10:43.000
without wearing himself out.
又不会让自己疲惫不堪。

10:43.000 --> 10:46.900
Do you understand
why I tell you this tale?
你明白吗
我为什么要告诉你这个故事？

10:46.900 --> 10:47.900
[all snoring]
[全都打呼噜]

10:47.900 --> 10:48.900
- Hello?
Wake up.
- 你好？
醒来吧。

10:48.900 --> 10:50.200
[all exclaim]
[所有人惊呼]

10:50.200 --> 10:52.233
- I didn't know
there was gonna be a test.
- 我不知道
将会有一个测试。

10:52.233 --> 10:54.933
- Oh, I got so wrapped up
in not letting anyone down
- 哦，我太着迷了
不让任何人失望

10:54.933 --> 10:57.333
that I asked too much
of my tree...
我问得太多了
我的树...

10:57.333 --> 10:58.667
and my friends.
和我的朋友们。

10:58.667 --> 11:00.533
- Perhaps with many trees,
- 也许有很多树，

11:00.533 --> 11:02.867
you could continue
serving your community
你可以继续
为您的社区服务

11:02.867 --> 11:06.333
in a natural
and sustainable manner.
在自然的
和可持续的方式。

11:06.333 --> 11:08.633
I mean, pretty much anything
is better than this mess.
我的意思是，几乎任何东西
总比这乱七八糟的好。

11:08.633 --> 11:09.633
Yeesh.
是啊。

11:09.633 --> 11:10.967
- Thanks, Shammy,
- 谢谢，沙米，

11:10.967 --> 11:13.267
but I'm a one-tree
kind of squirrel.
但我是一棵独树
一种松鼠。

11:13.267 --> 11:15.700
I'm gonna do what I should've
done in the first place:
我会做我应该做的事
首先完成：

11:15.700 --> 11:16.900
order the ole girl
点了老女孩

11:16.900 --> 11:20.133
some nutritious
new dirt from Texas.
一些有营养的
来自德克萨斯州的新泥土。

11:20.133 --> 11:21.367
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

11:21.367 --> 11:24.233
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

11:24.233 --> 11:26.267
- Well, my work here is done.
- 好了，我的工作已经完成了。

11:26.267 --> 11:29.600
It's time
I return to my people.
是时候了
我回到我的人民身边。

11:29.600 --> 11:34.100
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

11:34.100 --> 11:36.433
Let me offer some sage advice.
让我提供一些明智的建议。

11:36.433 --> 11:39.067
You must listen to the earth
and the stars,
你必须倾听大地的声音
和星星，

11:39.067 --> 11:41.100
for only they can guide you...
因为只有他们才能引导你......

11:41.100 --> 11:43.067
to my stop at the corner
of Olive and Victory.
到我在拐角处的车站
橄榄与胜利。

11:43.067 --> 11:46.100
- Sir, stand behind
the white line, please.
- 先生，站在后面
请画白线。

11:46.100 --> 11:48.467
- Typical.
It never ends.
- 典型的。
它永远不会结束。

- 典型的。
它永远不会结束。